<title>UK: METALS REMAIN SOFT ON LME, THREATEN DOWNSIDE.</title>
<headline>METALS REMAIN SOFT ON LME, THREATEN DOWNSIDE.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Trading near lows, could break under $2,260.</p>
<p>ZINC - Above low, but vulnerable after stocks rise.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Easier around lows. Hit by stock increase.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Falls below $6,800.</p>
<p>LEAD - Soggy near recent 22-month low.</p>
<p>TIN - Pressured by liquidation.</p>
